            "review_title": "Review at PizzAmore",
            "review_text": "judge\n3 contributions\n0\nNew Menu - Delicious\nNov 2019 • Solo\nIt has been over a year since Pizzamore opened and I love it even more. Predominately serving pizzas with a few pastas and salads also, everything is delicious. The owner and chef is from Italy and if he isn't making the fantastic food he is overseeing the entire process. This is authentic thin crust pizza with either a red or white sauce and the accompanying toppings. While you can create your own pizza I highly recommend ordering just as the menu has it. The paired toppings and sauces are perfect. \n\nI have had most all of the pizzas and salads. My most recent was the supreme pizza, pictured. Phenomenal is all I can say.\n\nIngredients are fresh, service is great, and the outcome is nearly life changing.\n\nThe open kitchen restaurant only has a few tables, but they have their own delivery staff and can deliver to most anywhere in D2.\n\nBest pizza in town.\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
