            "review_text": "HeartofDarkness321\nSaigon21 contributions\n0\nDont miss this Pizza\nNov 2018 • Solo\nI just moved to the Thao Dien neighborhood and have seen this place, but never stopped. I love pizza and gave it a try tonight. I order the prochuitto and mushroom pizza. I was shocked and in heaven at the same time. Very good pizza. Crisp but not dry crust. Topings fresh and flavorful. One pizza was pretty large size..possibly share with a friend and try some other tasty bits. \nOwner is a western guy and does ask how the food is. The do provide delivery so pretty much all of TD can enjoy this authentic pizza. Vegetarian available!\nI will go back and try a Calzone or a basil/margarita pizza. \nService...great. spot on. \nCheers and Thanks for you PizzAmore\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
