            "review_title": "Review at PizzAmore",
            "review_text": "Will Knight\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam40 contributions\n0\nUnsung Hero\nAug 2018 • Friends\nUnsung Hero Alert!\n\nMattia Di Paolo opened up his tiny 3 table Pizza place a month ago... u may remember his post with awesome photos a little while back... \nHe moved to Vietnam a year and a bit ago... worked with Pendolasco then La Betolla and decided life was too short and wanted to spread his wings.\nIn Vietnam, it takes a brave person to do that IMO and I admire everyone who has come here and done so. \nAnd so, here he is...\nI took a visiting Japanese dancing friend with me and she loved it here.\n\nMattia doesn't use a wood fired oven but bakes straight onto the stones in his imported Italian oven. When done well, it is better than many wood fired pizza places I know :)\nThe pizza were cooked to perfection... we had the Bomba (Onion, Sausage, Gorgonzola, Mushrooms and Ham) and the Burrata (Mozzerella, Rocket, Parma Ham and Burrata).\nBoth were incredible and if I am honest... the Burrata was the best I have had here and as many will know... i eat a lot of Pizza!!!\nFlavour combinations were balanced to perfection and the quality is up there with the best of them.\nDelivery in TD is fast (ok, not PendoFast but then he doesnt have 7 guys making Pizza!), but he is aiming for 30min deliveries.\n\nI really want this guy to do well... met him for the first time yesterday and i truly believe he deserves a good shot at success.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 12, 2018",
